## Additional Terms for ProfileCoder 3.3 Implementation

This software includes an implementation of the ProfileCoder 3.3 specification.
The ProfileCoder specification itself is subject to separate licensing terms.
Please refer to the specification documentation for details on ProfileCoder
usage rights and restrictions.

